  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Made from Sustainable MaterialsThese trainers comprise approximately 20% recycled content by weight.Product FeaturesSleek, low-top training shoes designed to handle your toughest workoutsTextile and synthetic upper wraps around your foot for a lightweight and breathable feelFlat, wide base helps keep you from sinking and a lace closure secures the fitNike iconography such as the Swoosh and Air Max detailing for a signature athletic lookFoam midsole with a Max Air unit in the heel cushions each step with comfort Flex grooves in the forefoot are designed for lunges with a flexible midsole and outsole for natural movementRubber wraps up the side to help keep your foot firmly on the sole during lateral movementThe Nike Air Max Alpha Trainer 6 Training Shoes are imported.Transform your training regimen and lace up the Men's Nike Air Max Alpha Trainer 6 Training Shoes. Built to bring sturdiness and comfort to your workouts and boosted with performance Air cushioning, these gym sneakers are the ultimate workout buddy, always ready to dig deep for one extra rep so you can hit your fitness goals. A flat, broad base and performance-first design equips them with everything you need to crush your workouts, from weights to HIIT to cardio.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Air Max Alpha Trainer 6 Training Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Phantom/Orange Pulse/Summit White/White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3477367</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Adult - Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike footwear size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 38.5</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 39</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.5</td></tr